WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:03.455
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> On their first date they went to a restaurant.

00:00:04.221 --> 00:00:06.873
<b>After that</b>, they started meeting every day.

00:00:08.852 --> 00:00:11.720
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> On Thursday I had an argument with my boss.

00:00:12.232 --> 00:00:14.698
<b>The next day</b>, I decided to look for a new job.

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:18.336
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> We sat down to eat.

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:20.972
<b>Two minutes later</b>, my phone rang.

00:00:23.002 --> 00:00:26.083
<b>When</b> I came out of the club, he was waiting for me.

00:00:28.157 --> 00:00:30.900
The accident happened <b>when</b> I was crossing the road.